  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      203.57,
      397.27,
      253.91
    ],
    "text": "which such bill of sale initially became legally enforceable,and any priority which such bill of sale became entitled toat the time it initially became leaglly enforceable, shallcontinue to prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      268.61,
      397.22,
      331.91
    ],
    "text": "(3) A bill of sale referred to in subsection (1) which is notregistered under the Secured Transactions Act, No. of 2019prior to the expiration of two years from the date of cominginto operation of this Act, shall become legally unenforceableafter the expiry of such period.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      346.61,
      397.2,
      370.91
    ],
    "text": "4.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
